## Additional Notes

### Brand Assets
The "TropiHug™" brand name, logo, and associated visual identity are fictional
and created solely for demonstration purposes. They are not registered trademarks.

### Images
Images used in this project are sourced from Google's public image repositories
for demonstration purposes. In a production environment, these should be replaced
with properly licensed images or original photography.

### Third-Party Dependencies
This project uses:
- Motion.dev (MIT License) - https://motion.dev
- Google Fonts (Open Font License) - https://fonts.google.com
